// FILE: {Module}.Application/Queries/{Entity}/List{Entities}/
//
// RULES APPLIED:
//   - SummaryDto with 5-8 key fields only — never full entity shape (P2)
//   - Pagination: default PageSize=20, max 100, validated (P3)
//   - AsNoTracking for reads (P8) — repo default
//   - Projections via .Select() — only load needed columns (P5)
//   - Ordered results — always specify OrderBy
//   - CancellationToken passed everywhere (P1)
//   - Cache pattern included (commented — enable when IMemoryCache is registered)
